# ── How to generate secrets (PowerShell / Node) ─────────────────────────────
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET / TICKET_SECRET / PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# Or: openssl rand -hex 32
# ADMIN_PASSWORD: choose a long unique password (not shared with customer accounts)
# Put the SAME values on Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# Never commit real .env values to git.

ADMIN_PASSWORD=
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=
